{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q410663","formula":"C₂₀H₂₉FO₃","hill":"C20H29FO3","elements":["H","C","O","F"],"composition":{"C":20.0,"F":1.0,"H":29.0,"O":3.0},"names":{"en":"Fluoxymesterone","uk":"Флуоксиместерон"},"descriptions":{"en":"Fluoxymesterone, sold under the brand names Halotestin and Ultandren among others, is an androgen and anabolic steroid (AAS) medication which is used in the treatment of low testosterone levels in men, delayed puberty in boys, breast cancer in women, and anemia. It is taken by mouth. Side effects of fluoxymesterone include symptoms of masculinization like acne, increased hair growth, voice changes, and increased sexual desire.","uk":"Флуоксиместерон (англ. Fluoxymesterone), що продається під низкою торгових марок, зокрема «Галотестин» і «Ультандрен» — андрогенний анаболічний стероїд, який використовується для лікування низького рівня тестостерону в чоловіків, затримки статевого дозрівання у хлопчиків, раку молочної залози в жінок та анемії. Флуоксиместерон приймають перорально."},"fame":18,"pubchemCid":6446,"mass":336.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@]12CCC(=O)C=C1CC[C@@H]3[C@@]2([C@H](C[C@]4([C@H]3CC[C@]4(C)O)C)O)F","inchikey":"YLRFCQOZQXIBAB-RBZZARIASA-N","iupac":"(8S,9R,10S,11S,13S,14S,17S)-9-fluoro-11,17-dihydroxy-10,13,17-trimethyl-1,2,6,7,8,11,12,14,15,16-decahydrocyclopenta[a]phenanthren-3-one","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"6446","atoms":53,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-0.505,"y":0.004,"z":1.436,"el":"F"},{"x":5.046,"y":-0.806,"z":0.068,"el":"O"},{"x":0.379,"y":-2.309,"z":-1.17,"el":"O"},{"x":-5.71,"y":0.32,"z":1.136,"el":"O"},{"x":2.618,"y":-0.415,"z":-0.094,"el":"C"},{"x":1.81,"y":0.887,"z":0.077,"el":"C"},{"x":0.412,"y":0.825,"z":-0.558,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.399,"y":-0.339,"z":0.096,"el":"C"},{"x":3.978,"y":0.006